    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "2. Heard learned counsel for the petitioner and the learned Additional Public Prosecutor for the State.\n3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 520,
      "end": 626,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner would submit that this is a covered matter in view of the earlier common order passed by this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and batch, whereby this Court has quashed several Charge Sheets as well as F.I.Rs filed for the similar offences based on identical facts.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 627,
      "end": 938,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 765,
          "end": 799
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1763639599084854
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Therefore, he would submit that the petitioner is similarly placed and therefore,\nentitled for quash of the Charge Sheet filed against him.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 939,
      "end": 1078,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20314890146255493
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "4. Learned Additional Public Prosecutor fairly concedes that this is a covered matter in view of the aforesaid common order passed by this Court and thereby prayed to pass appropriate orders accordingly in this Criminal Petition also.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1080,
      "end": 1314,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1385328471660614
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "5. Therefore, in view of the aforesaid common order of this Court and for the reasons stated therein,\nthis Criminal Petition is allowed and the aforesaid Charge Sheet filed against the petitioner, is hereby quashed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1316,
      "end": 1531,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1224105954170227
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Miscellaneous Petitions, if any pending, in this Criminal Petition, shall stand closed.",
